<Layout title="About — Jayden Park" description="Meet Jayden Park: fine artist, visual designer, and Vanderbilt student exploring art, business, and human connection."><div class="wrap"><div class="about-overview"><div class="about-story"><header class="page-head about-intro"><div class="about-intro-copy"><p class="eyebrow">THE STORYTELLER</p><h1><strong>Hey, I’m Jayden</strong><span class="about-greeting">&amp; i'm glad you're here :)</span></h1></div></header><div class="about-text about-bio"><p>I am a senior at Vanderbilt University studying Human and Organizational Development (HOD) with minors in Business and Art. I'm originally from Vancouver, Canada but have lived 10+ years in South Korea and the States!</p><p>The bulk of my work moves between traditional art, digital interfaces, and graphics made for the clubs and communities I serve with. This portfolio brings those different parts of my creative spectrum together.</p><p class="about-philosophy">My artistic philosophy is pretty simple:<strong>make ideas visible, then leave room for people to see them differently.</strong></p><AboutLinks/></div></div><AboutPhotos/></div><PersonalPlayground/></div></Layout>
